    "name": "TRUMP BREAKOUT",
    "steam_appid": 3182910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.poster.avif?t=1752280896\" width=600 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.webm?t=1752280896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.mp4?t=1752280896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Evolution of the Classic Breakout, Reborn for the Modern Era</strong><br><strong>Aim for high scores with combos!</strong> With block arrangements that change every time you play, this endlessly fresh version of Breakout never gets old. Packed with features like stage selection and a 9-tier ranking system, it's a satisfying experience from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/d648863c0b918bdef1077f212de49e88.avif?t=1752280896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo System</strong>: Rack up massive scores by destroying blocks in quick succession!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Layouts</strong>: Block arrangements change every time \u2014 with over 30,000 possible variations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage Selection</strong>: Freely choose any stage from 1 to 10 and take on the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranking System</strong>: Your score and progress are graded across 9 ranks, from S+ to E.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Graphics</strong>: Cool and stunning visuals with effects reminiscent of 1980s arcade games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Over Conditions</strong>: The tension runs high \u2014 five mistakes and it's game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/a4539043a7b72bf3fb29d9ec3d4641d4.avif?t=1752280896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Major Update Coming May 2025!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this major update, the game has evolved into an entirely new dimension of Breakout.<br>Rebuilt from the ground up and featuring a complete graphics overhaul, the combo system adds a whole new layer of fun to score attacks.<br>While staying true to the soul of the classic, this modern version will captivate today\u2019s players as well.<br>Get ready for a cool and emotional Breakout experience like never before.<br><i>Note: Please uninstall the previous version before reinstalling the update.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tribute to the 1970s</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game out of a deep passion for Atari\u2019s <i>Breakout</i> from the 1970s.<br>I still vividly remember the shock and excitement I felt experiencing it in an era when video games were barely a thing.<br>Its simple yet addictive gameplay, the slowly advancing blocks, and the thrill of testing your reflexes \u2014 I wanted to relive that magic, and that\u2019s what drove me to make this.<br><i>Breakout</i> is back after 50 years. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.poster.avif?t=1752280896\" width=600 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.webm?t=1752280896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/aadb45f5e5b47c571a3c9bc44107523f.mp4?t=1752280896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Evolution of the Classic Breakout, Reborn for the Modern Era</strong><br><strong>Aim for high scores with combos!</strong> With block arrangements that change every time you play, this endlessly fresh version of Breakout never gets old. Packed with features like stage selection and a 9-tier ranking system, it's a satisfying experience from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/d648863c0b918bdef1077f212de49e88.avif?t=1752280896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo System</strong>: Rack up massive scores by destroying blocks in quick succession!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Layouts</strong>: Block arrangements change every time \u2014 with over 30,000 possible variations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage Selection</strong>: Freely choose any stage from 1 to 10 and take on the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranking System</strong>: Your score and progress are graded across 9 ranks, from S+ to E.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Graphics</strong>: Cool and stunning visuals with effects reminiscent of 1980s arcade games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Over Conditions</strong>: The tension runs high \u2014 five mistakes and it's game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182910/extras/a4539043a7b72bf3fb29d9ec3d4641d4.avif?t=1752280896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Major Update Coming May 2025!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this major update, the game has evolved into an entirely new dimension of Breakout.<br>Rebuilt from the ground up and featuring a complete graphics overhaul, the combo system adds a whole new layer of fun to score attacks.<br>While staying true to the soul of the classic, this modern version will captivate today\u2019s players as well.<br>Get ready for a cool and emotional Breakout experience like never before.<br><i>Note: Please uninstall the previous version before reinstalling the update.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tribute to the 1970s</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game out of a deep passion for Atari\u2019s <i>Breakout</i> from the 1970s.<br>I still vividly remember the shock and excitement I felt experiencing it in an era when video games were barely a thing.<br>Its simple yet addictive gameplay, the slowly advancing blocks, and the thrill of testing your reflexes \u2014 I wanted to relive that magic, and that\u2019s what drove me to make this.<br><i>Breakout</i> is back after 50 years. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
